tation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-074","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-074-ws1536331"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p022","text":"帝遣侍中羅含以牛酒犒溫于山陽，使會稽王昱會溫於途中，詔以溫世子給事熙為征虜將軍、豫州刺史、假節。及南康公主薨，詔賻布千匹，錢百萬，溫辭不受。又陳息熙三年之孤，且年少未宜使居偏任，詔不許。發州人築廣陵城，移鎮之。時溫行役既久，又兼疾癘，死者十四五，百姓嗟怨。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2614273-raw.wikitext","raw_start":12770,"raw_end":12898,"character_positions":[12770,12771,12772,12773,12774,12775,12776,12777,12778,12779,12780,12781,12782,12783,12784,12785,12786,12787,12788,12789,12790,12791,12792,12793,12794,12795,12796,12797,12798,12799,12800,12801,12802,12803,12804,12805,12806,12807,12808,12809,12810,12811,12812,12813,12814,12815,12816,12817,12818,12819,12820,12821,12822,12823,12824,12825,12826,12827,12828,12829,12830,12831,12832,12833,12834,12835,12836,12837,12838,12839,12840,12841,12842,12843,12844,12845,12846,12847,12848,12849,12850,12851,12852,12853,12854,12855,12856,12857,12858,12859,12860,12861,12862,12863,12864,12865,12866,12867,12868,12869,12870,12871,12872,12873,12874,12875,12876,12877,12878,12879,12880,12881,12882,12883,12884,12885,12886,12887,12888,12889,12890,12891,12892,12893,12894,12895,12896,12897]},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p022:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"07f_24w_7uz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p022:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"羅含","kind":"person","person_id":"txo_nd1_o62","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p022:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"溫","kind":"person","person_id":"8uq_4jd_30f","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-huanwen:p022:m0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"會稽王昱","kind":"person","per